#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:10
msgid "本章将学习 PyTorch 中改变张量\"形状\"的各种操作，理解它们如何对应神经网络中的数据流转。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:12
msgid "形状操作：改变张量的\"视图\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:14
msgid "Reshape vs View：重新排列元素"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:16
msgid "Reshape 和 View 就像重新排列书架上的书——书还是那些书，但摆放方式变了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"\n"
"# 原始张量：2 张 3×4 的特征图（如卷积层输出）\n"
"x = torch.randn(2, 3, 4)\n"
"print(f\"原始形状: {x.shape}\")  # torch.Size([2, 3, 4])\n"
"\n"
"# reshape/view：改变形状，但不改变数据\n"
"# 想象把书架从 2×3×4 重新排列成 6×4\n"
"y = x.reshape(6, 4)  # 或 x.view(6, 4)\n"
"print(f\"reshape 后: {y.shape}\")  # torch.Size([6, 4])\n"
"\n"
"# 元素数量必须一致：2×3×4 = 6×4 = 24\n"
"print(f\"元素数量: {x.numel()} == {y.numel()}\")  # True\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:34
msgid "reshape vs view 的区别"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:37
msgid ""
"**view**：要求张量在内存中是**连续的**，速度更快但不灵活   "
"**reshape**：可以处理非连续张量（必要时复制数据），更灵活但可能稍慢"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:40
msgid "**建议**：能用 view 就用 view，不确定时用 reshape **reshape 的可视化**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:45
msgid "reshape 操作示意图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:80
msgid "**在神经网络中的应用**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# CNN → 全连接的经典转换\n"
"conv_output = torch.randn(64, 32, 28, 28)  # batch=64, 32通道, 28×28特征图\n"
"\n"
"# 展平为全连接层的输入：64 个样本，每个 32×28×28 = 25088 维\n"
"fc_input = conv_output.reshape(64, -1)  # -1 表示自动计算\n"
"print(f\"展平后: {fc_input.shape}\")  # torch.Size([64, 25088])\n"
"\n"
"# 这就是 {doc}`../cnn-expedition/practice-peak/le-net` 中 C5 层到 F6 层的操作！\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:93
msgid "squeeze 与 unsqueeze：增减维度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:95
msgid "**直觉**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:97
msgid "**unsqueeze**：在指定位置插入一个维度为 1 的轴（增加一个\"壳\"）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:98
msgid "**squeeze**：移除所有维度为 1 的轴（剥掉\"壳\"）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:100
msgid "**squeeze/unsqueeze 的可视化**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:108
msgid ""
"squeeze 和 unsqueeze 操作示意图：squeeze 移除维度为 1 的轴，unsqueeze 在指定位置添加维度为 1 "
"的轴。图中展示了 2D 张量如何通过不同的 unsqueeze 操作变成不同形状的 3D 张量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:111
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# 单张图片：[3, 224, 224] —— 没有 batch 维度\n"
"image = torch.randn(3, 224, 224)\n"
"print(f\"原始: {image.shape}\")  # torch.Size([3, 224, 224])\n"
"\n"
"# unsqueeze(0)：在第 0 维添加 batch 维度\n"
"batch_image = image.unsqueeze(0)\n"
"print(f\"加 batch 维度: {batch_image.shape}\")  # torch.Size([1, 3, 224, "
"224])\n"
"\n"
"# 也可以在其他位置添加\n"
"channel_first = image.unsqueeze(1)  # 在通道维度前添加\n"
"print(f\"在中间添加: {channel_first.shape}\")  # torch.Size([3, 1, 224, 224])\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:125
msgid "**squeeze 的用法**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/tensor-ops.md:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# 模型输出的 logits：[batch, 1] —— 多余的维度\n"
"logits = torch.randn(64, 1)\n"
"\n"
"# squeeze()：移除所有维度为 1 的轴\n"
"predictions = logits.squeeze()  # 或 logits.squeeze(1)\n"
"print(f\"squeeze 后: {predictions.shape}\")  # torch.Size([64])\n"
"\n"
"# 注意：squeeze 只移除维度为 1 的轴，不会删除其他维度\n"
"x = torch.randn(2, 1, 3, 1, 4)\n"
"print(f\"squeeze 后: {x.squeeze().shape}\")  # torch.Size([2, 3, 4])\n"
msgstr ""

